Industrial roles

GregTech is the primary electrical and industrial backbone.

Modern Industrialization is complementary and must not provide an alternate route around GregTech.

Create owns early mechanical processing, logistics, and mechanical automation.

Mekanism becomes increasingly important for chemistry, specialized processing, and advanced energy systems.

AE2 becomes the primary high-tier digital logistics and automation layer.

Create Aeronautics and Create Big Cannons become specialized industrial systems integrated into the appropriate tiers.

Implementation policy

Every new progression layer must first establish its materials and infrastructure requirements.

Recipes should create infrastructure requirements rather than arbitrary material inflation.

Automation should solve scale rather than bypass progression.

Cross-mod dependencies should appear where they represent meaningful technological integration.

ProjectE remains post-endgame.

Avaritia remains the final progression system.

Testing requirement

After each major recipe layer is implemented, the pack must be launched and recipes verified in JEI and in actual crafting before the next layer is expanded.
